  - id: five_books_of_psalms
    displayName: The Five Books
    flavorText: Organizes the entire Psalter into five books, each closing with its
      own doxology, mirroring the five books of the Torah.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "The Psalter is organized into five books (1-41, 42-72, 73-89, 90-106,
      107-150), each closing with a doxology, mirroring the five books of the Torah
      \u2014 framing Israel's whole worship-book as a structured response to God's
      law."
    deliveredByManagerId: 
