  - id: psalm_23_the_shepherd_psalm
    displayName: The Shepherd's Psalm
    flavorText: Portrays the LORD as a shepherd who guides, provides, and prepares
      a table even 'in the presence of mine enemies.'
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "A short psalm of trust portraying the LORD as a shepherd who provides,
      guides, and protects, and as a host who welcomes the psalmist to a table even
      'in the presence of mine enemies' \u2014 likely the single most widely memorized
      passage in the entire Bible, central to this game's mission."
    deliveredByManagerId: david
